  "• Enables \"Segments\". \n• Deselecting this option is only recommended for those with powerful PCs.": "• 启用分段处理。\n• 仅建议高性能电脑取消此选项。",
  "• Select a model from the list of lead and backing vocal models to run through vocal stems automatically.": "• 选择主唱与和声模型，自动对已提取的人声继续分离。",
  "• Select the vocal type you wish to deverb automatically.\n       - Example: Choosing \"Lead Vocals Only\" will only remove reverb from a lead vocal stem.": "• 选择自动去混响的人声类型。\n  - 例如：Lead Vocals Only 仅处理主唱分轨。",
  "• The segment size is set based on the value provided in a chosen model's associated \nconfig file (yaml).": "• 使用所选模型关联的 YAML 配置文件中指定的分段大小。",
  "• This application is intended for those running Linux Ubuntu 18.04+.\n• Application functionality for systems running other Linux platforms is not guaranteed.\n• Application functionality for older or budget systems is not guaranteed.": "• 此应用适用于 Ubuntu 18.04 及更新版本。\n• 不保证在其他 Linux 发行版上正常运行。\n• 较老或低配设备的运行情况需实际验证。",
  "• This application is intended for those running Windows 10 or higher.\n• Application functionality for systems running Windows 7 or lower is not guaranteed.\n• Application functionality for Intel Pentium & Celeron CPUs systems is not guaranteed.": "• 此应用适用于 Windows 10 及更新版本。\n• 不保证在 Windows 7 或更早版本上正常运行。\n• Intel Pentium 或 Celeron 设备的运行情况需实际验证。",
  "• This application is intended for those running macOS Big Sur and above.\n• Application functionality for systems running macOS Catalina or lower is not guaranteed.\n• Application functionality for older or budget Mac systems is not guaranteed.": "• 此应用适用于 macOS Big Sur 及更新版本。\n• 不保证在 macOS Catalina 或更早版本上正常运行。\n• 较老或低配 Mac 的运行情况需实际验证。",
  "• This option controls the amount of overlap between prediction windows.\n       - Higher values can provide better results, but will lead to longer processing times.": "• 控制推理窗口之间的重叠率。\n  - 较高的值可能改善效果，但处理时间会增加。",
  "• This option controls the amount of overlap between prediction windows.\n       - Higher values can provide better results, but will lead to longer processing times.\n       - For Non-MDX23C models: You can choose between 0.001-0.999": "• 控制推理窗口之间的重叠率。\n  - 较高的值可能改善效果，但处理时间会增加。\n  - 非 MDX23C 模型的可选范围为 0.001–0.999。",
  "• This option controls the amount of overlap between prediction windows.\n       - Higher values can provide better results, but will lead to longer processing times.\n       - You can choose between 0.001-0.999": "• 控制推理窗口之间的重叠率。\n  - 较高的值可能改善效果，但处理时间会增加。\n  - 可选范围为 0.001–0.999。",
  "• This option removes reverb from a vocal stem.\n       - You must have the \"UVR-DeEcho-DeReverb\" VR Arch model installed to use this option.\n       - This option does not work in ensemble mode at this time.": "• 去除人声分轨中的混响。\n  - 需要安装 UVR-DeEcho-DeReverb 模型。\n  - 此版本暂不支持在模型集成模式中使用。",
  "• When activated, you will receive extra instrumental outputs that include: one with just the lead vocals and another with only the backing vocals.": "• 启用后会额外输出两种伴奏：一种保留主唱，另一种保留和声。",
